 trustTop:'03 / OPEN CODE. CLEAR LIMITS.', trustHeading:['Trust needs','transparency.'], trustIntro:'NeutronDrive uses Proton’s open-source SDK for account access, encryption and service requests. Sign-in takes place on Proton’s website in your browser.', security:'Read the security approach', trust:[['Independent. And open.','A community project under the MIT licence. Not affiliated with, endorsed by or officially supported by Proton AG.'],['Beta means still in development.','Keep an independent backup. Not all features of the Windows and macOS clients are available. Packages are currently unsigned.'],['Local files remain local files.','Synchronised files and local caches are stored as plaintext on your device. Protect your user account and use disk encryption if needed.']],
